    <p class="intro">
      Amazon A+ Content is a great way to make your products stand out among the competition. You will have access to richer multimedia tools, allowing you to effectively grab the attention of potential customers.
    </p>
    <p>
      However, brands using A+ Content must adhere strictly to Amazon's publishing guidelines. Amazon reviews and requires approval for all content before it goes live.
    </p>
  </header>

  <!-- Tabla de Contenidos -->
